        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Remove redundant indefinite articles from var/param/etc names]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40795</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40795"/>
        <updated>2025-08-19T15:25:59.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26078826?u=9388a2c2a0f1ca2799a4fd23f3e060c353d6ac37&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Remove redundant indefinite articles <code class="notranslate">a</code> from var/param/etc names (e.g. <code class="notranslate">aCar</code> -&gt; <code class="notranslate">car</code>).</p>
<p dir="auto">Mostly this is just grepping <code class="notranslate">\ba([A-Z])(\w{2,30}(?![+/=])\b)</code> and replacing with <code class="notranslate">\l$1$2</code>, with a few context-sensitive exceptions.</p>
<p dir="auto">Excluded cases where the <code class="notranslate">a</code> had a clear purpose (e.g. <code class="notranslate">aElem</code> = an anchor element), as well as files under <code class="notranslate">mozilla/firefox/releases</code> (release notes) and <code class="notranslate">webgl*,webxr*</code> (I don't know if webgl has some convention around this or if the <code class="notranslate">a</code>s there had some significance).</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Per linked issue</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Bikeshedding — does MDN have a general style preference between <code class="notranslate">showDefaultUI</code> vs <code class="notranslate">showDefaultUi</code> style for camel-cased vars? The <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Writing_guidelines/Code_style_guide/JavaScript#variable_names" rel="nofollow">writing guide</a> currently doesn't seem to mention it.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #40794.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3334171970" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40794" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40794/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40794">#40794</a></p>]]></content>
